DESCRIPTION:Caring Through the Holidays\nComfort\, Care\, and Connect ❤
 ️\nMeaningful moments with loved ones\, cherished traditions\, and the s
 upport to enjoy them. Join us this Thursday for conversations about comfor
 t\, care\, and quality of life this holiday season.\n✨ Dolly Brandt with
  Compassus Hospice & Palliative Care and Chrissy Thompson with HOPE Health
 care & Hospice will share how hospice care can support individuals and fam
 ilies\, bringing comfort and helping make room for the moments that matter
  most.\n✨ Dr. Lauren Young with NeuroElite PT will introduce specialized
  rehabilitation for individuals with neurologic conditions\, exploring way
 s to support mobility\, independence\, and quality of life while helping f
 amilies better support their loved ones.\nWhether you’re caring for some
 one you love or connecting families with resources\, come learn and connec
 t with us!\n📅 Thursday\, November 19\n⏰ 9:00–10:30 AM\n📍 Hosted 
 by Buckner Prosthetics\nBring a friend and join us!\nFree for members and 
 $20 for non-members. Includes breakfast\, coffee\, education & meaningful 
 conversation. Registration required! ❤️\nLink below!\nHub City Connect
 \nEngage. Empower. Educate.\n\nhttps://happeningnext.com/event/coffee-anda
